'''Sand Cage'''{{Unofficial}} is a earth-type [[Spells|spell]] that creates a cage made from walls of sand.

==Description==
The casting seal for this spell contains the Sigil of [[Sigils Explained#Earth|Earth]], two Signs of [[Signs Explained#Columns|Columns]] and two Signs of [[Signs Explained#Crushing|Crushing]] that make up the [[Wall Breaker Seal]]. In addition to this, there are two inverted Columns and some unknown symbols. 

Of the unknown symbols, two of them appear to look like the Sign of [[Signs#Binding|Binding]] with only one curved line. This sign is also present in [[Sand Bridge]]. The other four appear to look like a fusion of one Column Sign and two [[Signs#Regions|Region]] Signs pointing inwards.{{Ref|m|28|21}} It is unclear what these symbols contribute to the spell in relation to it's effect, and it's visual similarities to existing signs may not mean anything.

The Wall Breaker seal crushes stone into sand, which is then manipulated into thick panels that rise in a spiral formation before hardening once again. Tetia describes the effect as "thick panels made the same way we turn sand into ''cloth!''"{{Ref|m|28|21}}

==Usage==
[[File:Sand_Cage_Effect_Tetia.png|left|thumb|Tetia casting Sand Cage|304x304px]]
[[File:Sand_Cage_Effect_Agott.png|thumb|right|Agott and Brushbuddy at the top of the Sand Cage|206x206px]]
[[File:Sand_Cage_Effect_Coco.png|245x245px|right|thumb|Coco casting Sand Cage]]
Sand Cage is first seen used by [[Tetia]] to trap a transformed [[Euini]] inside, as part of the [[Qifrey's Atelier|girls']] plan to turn back Euini. [[Agott]] and [[Brushbuddy (Character)|Brushbuddy]] then jump down from the top of the cage to hold down Euini and draw the [[Inverted Scalewolf Curse|reversed casting seal]] on him.{{Ref|m|28|21}}
[[Coco]] uses a spell visually similar to Sand Cage when confronting [[Ininia]], drawing the seal on the ground with raw [[Woodcruor]] staining her hands. Ininia, unfazed, simply [[Teleportation|teleports]] outside of the cage.{{Ref|m|87|9-10}}
